    "html": "<p>Correct answer: B</p>\n<p>A: Useful output power is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Fv=(1.0\\,\\text{kN})(0.60\\,\\text{m s}^{-1})=0.60\\,\\text{kW}\"></span>. Efficiency <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"=\\frac{0.60}{1.5}=0.40=40\\,\\%\"></span>, so <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"15\\,\\%\"></span> is incorrect.</p>\n<p>B: Useful output power is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"P_{\\text{out}}=Fv=(1.0\\times10^3\\,\\text{N})(0.60\\,\\text{m s}^{-1})=600\\,\\text{W}=0.60\\,\\text{kW}\"></span>. Efficiency <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"=\\frac{P_{\\text{out}}}{P_{\\text{in}}}=\\frac{0.60}{1.5}=0.40=40\\,\\%\"></span>.</p>\n<p>C: Correct efficiency is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"40\\,\\%\"></span> from <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\eta=\\frac{Fv}{P_{\\text{in}}}=\\frac{(1.0\\,\\text{kN})(0.60\\,\\text{m s}^{-1})}{1.5\\,\\text{kW}}=0.40\"></span>, so <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"60\\,\\%\"></span> is incorrect.</p>\n<p>D: Correct efficiency is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"40\\,\\%\"></span> from <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\eta=\\frac{Fv}{P_{\\text{in}}}=\\frac{(1.0\\,\\text{kN})(0.60\\,\\text{m s}^{-1})}{1.5\\,\\text{kW}}=0.40\"></span>, so <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"67\\,\\%\"></span> is incorrect.</p>"
