  "question": {
    "html": "<p>An electric motor is used to pull a crate along a horizontal surface at a constant speed. The following data are available for the motor system:</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Power input to motor</td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.5\\,\\text{kW}\"></span></td></tr><tr><td>Constant speed of crate</td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.60\\,\\text{m s}^{-1}\"></span></td></tr><tr><td>Total resistive force acting on crate</td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.0\\,\\text{kN}\"></span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>What is the efficiency of the motor system?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"15\\,\\%\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"40\\,\\%\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"60\\,\\%\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"67\\,\\%\"></span></p></li></ol>"
